{"study_accession":"PRJNA587905","secondary_study_accession":"SRP228767","title":"The transcriptomic differences between Th1, Tr1, and Tneg cells in controlled human malaria infection","description":"This study was designed to determine the differences in gene transcripts between CD4+ T helper (Th)1, Tr1, and Tneg cells during controlled human malaria infection. Overall design: Bulk RNA-sequencing was performed on CD4+ T helper (Th)1 (IFNγ+ IL-10-), Tr1 (IFNγ+ IL-10+), and Tneg (IFNγ- IL-10-) cells sorted from the peripheral blood mononuclear cells (PBMCs) of n = 6 participants in a controlled human malaria infection trial at day 14 p.i. Cells were stimulated with phorbol 12-myristate 13-acetate (PMA) and ionomycin prior to sorting by cytokine capture flow cytometry.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":18,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN13221078","study_accession":"PRJNA587905","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"R402_TR1","description":"R402_TR1","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM4151221","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":4,"first_public":"2019-11-10","attributes":[["source_name","PBMCs"],["participant id","R402"],["tissue","Blood"],["timepoint","Day 14 p.i."],["cell_type","Tr1 cells"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR10407273","experiment_accession":"SRX7106561","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":1809940,"base_count":90497000,"first_public":"2019-11-10","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM4151221: R402_TR1 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},{"run_accession":"SRR10407274","experiment_accession":"SRX7106561","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":1819561,"base_count":90978050,"first_public":"2019-11-10","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 sequencing: GSM4151221: R402_TR1 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"},{"run_accession":"SRR10407275","experiment_accession":"SRX7106561","library_layout":"SINGLE"